* Lean psi_eq_sum_Gker: for squarefree T and M in NN, psi_T ( M ) = sum_ d | M G_T ( d ) with the finite kernel G_T ( d ) = prod_ p | d ( f ( p ) - 1 ) for d | T, else 0 (the Euler-product engine z5sqfeul at the divisors of ( T , M )).

